IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-ADVANCED-WEB-STACK.

DATA DIVISION.
01 H2-STREAM-ID        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 HISTORY-COUNT       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 CANVAS-CMD-COUNT    PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 ADV-WEB-SCORE       PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-ADVANCED-WEB.
    IF H2-STREAM-ID == 0
        GO TO ERROR-STATE.
    END-IF.

    IF HISTORY-COUNT == 0 OR CANVAS-CMD-COUNT == 0
        GO TO ERROR-STATE.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 9960 TO ADV-WEB-SCORE.
    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 H2-STREAM-ID.
    WEIGHT 30 CANVAS-CMD-COUNT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-STATE.
    MOVE 0 TO ADV-WEB-SCORE.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
